  "shortDescription": "Track game completion as a percentage.",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "description": [
    "This extension provides tracking game completion.",
    "",
    "High Precision: Uses an internal integer-based system to provide 1 decimal point of accuracy (0.1%) without floating-point errors.",
    "",
    "DLC Friendly: Supports completion beyond 100.0% for expansion content or \"True Completion\" goals.",
    "",
    "Clean UI Output: Includes an expression to return a perfectly formatted string (e.g., \"94.5%\") even when the value is a whole number."
  ],
